##* {{quote-web|en|author=Michele M. Murphy, Justice, {{w|Court of Appeal of Prince Edward Island}}|title=R. v. Yeo &#91;[2016] PEIJ No 14 (QL)&#93;|work=[[w:CanLII|Canadian Legal Information Institute]]|url=https://www.canlii.org/en/pe/pescad/doc/2016/2016peca3/2016peca3.html|date=18 April 2016|section=paragraph 30|passage=There were a few errors in the testimony of [a civilian witness] which the trial judge noted&nbsp;– one, that they '''attended''' at the Fairhurst residence the day before the robbery, and two, that Wakelin was with them.}}
